sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  box #E3F2FD Platform (Microsoft Commercial Marketplace)
    participant MP as 平台：Marketplace
    participant SF as 平台：SaaS Fulfillment API
  end

  box #E8F5E9 Your implementation (Publisher SaaS)
    participant WH as 你方：Webhook
    participant SaaS as 你方：SaaS Backend
    participant DB as 你方：Subscription DB
  end

  Note over MP,SF: 平台侧（Marketplace 提供）
  Note over WH,DB: 你方实现侧（Publisher SaaS 要实现）

  MP->>WH: Notify change (plan/quantity)
  WH->>SaaS: Validate + enqueue event
  SaaS->>SF: Get operation/status (poll)
  SF-->>SaaS: Operation status
  alt Accepted
    SaaS->>DB: Update subscription + apply new entitlements
    SaaS-->>MP: Acknowledge/complete (per API)
  else Rejected
    SaaS->>DB: Record rejection reason
    SaaS-->>MP: Reject update (per API)
  end